  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"You can have it. I will give it to you.\"",
  "[action] O-lan takes the gold pin and hides it.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"But you must not take it from me.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"And shall I not have it then?\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) O-lan hides the gold pin in the wall.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"You will take it from me, but I will not give it to you.\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"It is better then that I should never have it,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"You may have it, then.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"I will go and buy another.\"",
